      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "32．把下列各式写成分式：",
        "а）$\\frac{c-a}a+\\frac b{b+c}$；　　б）$\\frac{x+1}{x-2}-\\frac{x+y}y$；",
        "в）$\\frac m{m-n}+\\frac n{m+n}$；　　г）$\\frac{2a}{2a-1}-\\frac1{2a+1}$；",
        "д）$\\frac{3x}{5(x+y)}-\\frac{2y}{3(x+y)}$；",
        "е）$\\frac{a^2}{5(a-b)}-\\frac{b^2}{4(a-b)}$．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "33",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "33．把下列各式变形成分式：",
        "а）$1-\\frac{a+b}{a-b}$；　　б）$\\frac{a^2+b^2}{a-b}-a$；",
        "в）$m-n+\\frac{n^2}{m+n}$；　　г）$a+b-\\frac{a^2+b^2}{a+b}$；",
        "д）$x-\\frac9{x-3}-3$；　　е）$a^2-\\frac{a^4+1}{a^2-1}+1$．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "34",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "34．找出下列各式的定义域并证明，对于定义域内所有变量",
        "值来说，下列各式的值与变量值无关：",
        "а）$\\frac{5x+3}{2(x+1)}-\\frac{7x+4}{3(x+1)}$；　　б）$\\frac{11y+13}{3y-3}+\\frac{15y+17}{4-4y}$．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "35",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "35．化简：",
        "а）$\\frac{a^2}{x(a-x)}+\\frac x{x-a}$；　　б）$\\frac{b^2-4by}{y(2y-b)}-\\frac{4y}{b-2y}$；",
        "в）$\\frac b{2a^2-ab}-\\frac{4a}{2ab-b^2}$；　　г）$\\frac{4y}{3x^2+2xy}-\\frac{9x}{3xy+2y^2}$．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "36",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "36．找出下列各式的定义域并化简：",
        "а）$\\frac{x-25}{5x-25}+\\frac{3x+5}{x^2-5x}$；　　б）$\\frac{12-y}{6y-36}-\\frac6{y^2-6y}$．"
      ]
    },
